# Flow: The sidebar file list is the one scrollable surface in the upper
# pane. The controls body must be exactly the outer panel's viewport
# height — any extra height gives the outer panel a scroll range, which
# clips the bottom of the file list and makes wheel/scrollbar input land
# on the chrome instead of the files. At 720 the pane itself is floored
# at header + chrome + five list rows (viewport 396), taken from the
# history pane's ratio share. Scrolling over the list must then reach
# the last file.
make_test_repo
resize 1280 720
wait_frames 5
wait_for_refresh
wait_frames 15
validate ui_height:files_controls_scroll=396.0
validate ui_height:files_controls_body=396.0
expect_no_text "icon.png"
mouse_move 140 410
scroll_wheel 0 -1000
wait_frames 10
expect_text "icon.png"
screenshot sidebar_files_scroll
